        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/3d4615e96e7fbafcf9d3e24355fcc03695e61f40/models/2026-delphi10000-equus-scotti-turing-wavelength-s0.py#L322-L343> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-equus-scotti-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-3> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
